{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2020-06", "window": 3, "start_date": 1592265600, "end_date": 1592870399, "month_true_total": 197, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:53:39 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "71189766", "author": {"steamid": "76561198019047833", "personaname": "Lucky", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198019047833/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 6150, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 628, "last_played": 1721028354, "avatar": "ac96a1f994560b9a1f4bd90fd6c4f8c51a7513c0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pleasantly surprised given the cool reception. Feels like true mass effect. Brings me back to ME1. Some of the story telling can be a little off at times but lots of good moments and fun new characters to meet!", "timestamp_created": 1592853062, "timestamp_updated": 1592853062, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.504372179508209229", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "71179766", "author": {"steamid": "76561198222571084", "personaname": "GhostGamer969", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198222571084/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1103, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 613, "last_played": 1621476025, "avatar": "cbe8ea92fe8474ffbd69cbf9f736509deca3a68e"}, "language": "english", "review": "awesome game\n", "timestamp_created": 1592837921, "timestamp_updated": 1592837921, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.437943190336227417", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "71179387", "author": {"steamid": "76561198035912541", "personaname": "Delmasca", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Delmasca/", "num_games_owned": 225, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 3740, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 597, "last_played": 1772984000, "avatar": "65b30e65035a84bff9bbf5fb52f5235615782e0e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Look, I'm not going to say its one of the best games out there. Yeah animations are odd and characters eyeballs seem to have  life of their own, but in the end its a pretty fun game. If you take it for what it is, a game placed in the Mass Effect Universe, then you can find some enjoyment out of it. If you are a classic ME fan like myself and have the ability to look past the technical issues then you can have some fun with this title. The multiplayer is actually enjoyable and the strike teams aspect is also fun. Character creation is kinda lack luster compared to ME 2+3. All and all its a game that's worth picking up when its on sale.", "timestamp_created": 1592837466, "timestamp_updated": 1592837466, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 11, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.539411187171936035", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 4, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "71177956", "author": {"steamid": "76561198021064434", "personaname": "Chicken1ps", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198021064434/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1102, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtim